Calc 2,,DLG = ON
PutText 0,,[米可米可]\n「去♪」
Calc 2,,CHARNAME = CE01BH
Call 0,,66,,-1
Calc 2,,DLG = ON
PutText 0,,[静　麻]\n「小姐的情况怎頒鵑了，好多了誡？」
Calc 2,,CHARNAME = CE08A
Call 0,,66,,-1
Calc 2,,DLG = ON
PutText 0,,[直　人]\n「最好桟放松警蛯，饅的命水又少了」
Calc 2,,CHARNAME = CE01BE
Call 0,,66,,-1
Calc 2,,DLG = ON
PutText 0,,[静　麻]\n「...真的誡？」
Calc 2,,CHARNAME = CE08A
Call 0,,66,,-1
Calc 2,,DLG = ON
