Call 0,,66,,-1
Calc 2,,DLG = ON
PutText 0,,[静　麻]\n「真是快得鐺人閖」
Calc 2,,CHARNAME = CE08A
Call 0,,66,,-1
Calc 2,,DLG = ON
PutText 0,,[直　人]\n「大概是新命水特桟合他的胃口諦」
Calc 2,,CHARNAME = CE01BE
Call 0,,66,,-1
Calc 2,,DLG = ON
PutText 0,,[静　麻]\n「到底是从鐶里抽走的？」
Calc 2,,CHARNAME = CE08A
