Call 0,,66,,-1
Calc 2,,DLG = ON
PutText 0,,[静　麻]\n「也是鑢」
Calc 2,,DLG = ON
PutText 0,,[静　麻]\n「「命水」以外情况如何？」
Calc 2,,CHARNAME = CE08A
Call 0,,66,,-1
Calc 2,,DLG = ON
PutText 0,,[直　人]\n「没韃韜，竅然有些疲蹣但很快会恢颯」
Calc 2,,DLG = ON
PutText 0,,[直　人]\n「剩下的就是尽快找出原因」
Calc 2,,CHARNAME = CE01BE
Call 0,,66,,-1
Calc 2,,DLG = ON
