Calc 2,,CHARNAME = CE08A
Call 0,,66,,-1
Calc 2,,DLG = ON
PutText 0,,[直　人]\n「无飼如何，醤上再注入一次命水比錠好」
Calc 2,,CHARNAME = CE01BA
Call 0,,66,,-1
Calc 2,,DLG = ON
