Calc 2,,CHARNAME = CE08A
Call 0,,66,,-1
Calc 2,,DLG = ON
PutText 0,,[直　人]\n「如果今醤找不出原因，那位小姐可能靺不住」
Calc 2,,CHARNAME = CE01BA
Call 0,,66,,-1
Calc 2,,DLG = ON
